{"id": "S0001", "offset": 0, "section": "abstract", "text": "摘要"}
{"id": "S0002", "offset": 3, "section": "abstract", "text": "本试点研究评估一种微波干燥工艺。"}
{"id": "S0003", "offset": 19, "section": "abstract", "text": "实验表明该工艺显著缩短干燥时间，并证明其可将能耗降低一半。"}
{"id": "S0004", "offset": 48, "section": "abstract", "text": "结果为农产品加工提供了确定性方案。"}
{"id": "S0005", "offset": 67, "section": "introduction", "text": "引言"}
{"id": "S0006", "offset": 70, "section": "introduction", "text": "微波干燥在农产品加工中应用广泛。"}
{"id": "S0007", "offset": 86, "section": "introduction", "text": "本文旨在测定工艺参数对干燥速率的影响。"}
{"id": "S0008", "offset": 107, "section": "methods", "text": "方法"}
{"id": "S0009", "offset": 110, "section": "methods", "text": "每组 3 个样本，微波功率 300 W，记录干燥时间与能耗。"}
{"id": "S0010", "offset": 142, "section": "results", "text": "结果"}
{"id": "S0011", "offset": 145, "section": "results", "text": "干燥时间由 120 分钟缩短至 70 分钟。"}
{"id": "S0012", "offset": 167, "section": "results", "text": "能耗由 2.0 降至 1.6 kWh。"}
{"id": "S0013", "offset": 188, "section": "discussion", "text": "讨论"}
{"id": "S0014", "offset": 191, "section": "discussion", "text": "干燥时间缩短表明传热效率提高。"}
{"id": "S0015", "offset": 206, "section": "discussion", "text": "该工艺证明了其在工业节能中的确定性价值。"}
{"id": "S0016", "offset": 228, "section": "references", "text": "参考文献"}
{"id": "S0017", "offset": 233, "section": "references", "text": "[1] 赵 et al., 微波干燥, 2016."}
